OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 380-home development on
OL,4,Afarmland submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new 380-home development in
OL,7,FDorset have been submitted.
OL,9,FAn outline planning application was put
OL,10,Fforward by Bristol-based Hallam Land
OL,11,FManagement Ltd for a site either side
OL,12,Fof Compton Road, just off the Sherborne
OL,13,FRoad and Babylon Hill, close to Yeovil.
OL,15,FThe proposals for the 37-hectare
OL,16,Ffarmland suggest that 35% of the homes
OL,17,Fwill be affordable and includes a new
OL,18,Fcountry park.
OL,20,FThe outline planning application is
OL,21,Fopen for public comment until
OL,22,Fmid-September.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
